        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.1+LUK.1.2+LUK.1.3+LUK.1.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 1.1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aigero te embuku naitera, Oloyanyiti Teofilo, mbaa pooki aaitera Yesu aas o naaiteng'enishe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o metabaiki ina olong apa nailepieki aaya shumata. Ore eton eitu eilepieki neitanapisho te ngolon e Nkiyang'et Sinyati, aitanap lelo tung'ana apa ootegelua metaa lkipaareta, lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te rishata oo nkolong'i artam, etulusoyie enkeeya enye, neitodol kewan ninche nkatitin kumok, too nkoitoi naaitadedeyie aaoru ninche olng'ash nchere keishu; netoduaa ninche ninye, eirorie ninche aimaki mbaa e nkitoria e Nkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.24.49"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 24.49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore pee etumo ninche te nebo, neitanap Yesu ajoki, “Emipuo aaing'uaa Yerusalem, kake entaanyu enkishorunoto natejo Papa keishoru, anaa enatiaaka intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 3.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 1.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 3.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.1.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yhn 1.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu te nkare apa eibatisishe Yohana, kake ore too nkuti olong'i, keibatisai intae te Nkiyang'et Sinyati.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eilepieki Yesu aaya shumata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enotote ilkipaareta te nebo neikilikuan Yesu aajoki, “Olaitoriani, ei te na rishata irrinyoki Siraeli enkitoria?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yesu ninche, “Ore rishat o nkatitin Papa lai ake openy oitore makewan, nemeishoro intae entayiolo enkata naaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.28.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 28.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.16.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 16.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.24.47+LUK.24.48"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 24.47-48",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake ing'amumu intae engolon, tene elotu Enkiyang'et Sinyati shumata intae, niaakuku intae lchakenini laainei ti atua Yerusalem, o ti atua Yudea pooki o Samaria, o metabaiki ineeiting'ie enkop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.16.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 16.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.24.50+LUK.24.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 24.50-51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore pee eidip atejo neijia, eing'orita ninche, neilepieki aaya keper neitemoo enkatampoi arishie nkonyek enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eimariri keper eduaaya ninye eloito, ore nabo kata nemaniki ltung'ana aare ooishopito nkilani naaibor eitashe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo, “Lo lewa le Galilaya, oo pee intasheshe te ne aaing'or keper? Ore Yesu, ele oilepieki aaitung'uaa intae aaya keper keitu aikununye anaa ina nitoduaaitie elo keper.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olotijing'a erishata e Yudas",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ninche aashuko Yerusalem aaing'uaa oldoinyo oji Olooloirienito otaaniki Yerusalem oba anaa elototo e nkolong e sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.2+MAT.10.3+MAT.10.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10.2-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.3.16+MRK.3.17+MRK.3.18+MRK.3.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 3.16-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.6.14+LUK.6.15+LUK.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 6.14-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejing ninche Yerusalem nepuo aailepaki olgilata le shumata le nkaji apa natijing'a: Aa Petero, Yohana, Yakobo o Anterea, Filipo o Tomas, Bartolomayo o Matayo, Yakobo le Alfayo o Simon loo olkirowuai, o Yudas ole Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiturrurro pooki anaa ake aasaisho te nebo, netii nkituaak naaisiritore, inaatii Mariamu ng'otonye Yesu o lalashera lenyena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tenena olong'i neitashe Petero tiatua ilalashera, oobaya eumata oo ltung'ana oobaya esiana iip o tikitam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo, “Ilalashera laainei, meeta kata apake nemeitabari ilkigerot anaa enatejo Enkiyang'et Sinyati, alimunye Daudi, eimaki Yudas, laa ninye otorikuo ltung'ana ooetuo aaibung Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ole siana ang apa Yudas neishooki ematua enye te na siaai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.27.3+MAT.27.4+MAT.27.5+MAT.27.6+MAT.27.7+MAT.27.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 27.3-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Neinyiang'ua ele tung'ani enkurma to lerrinyore le nkarrueisho enye, naa ine etanang'a etusulari neng'era adanya neitiakunye enkoshoke pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nening iltung'ana pooki oomanya Yerusalem ina, nedung'oki ina kurma enkarna te nkutuk enye aajo Akeldama, (eji ‘Enkurma osarge’). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
